{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47157","headline":"赠岛云禅师 · 昙域","name":"赠岛云禅师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远庵枯叶满，羣鹿亦相随。\n顶骨生新发，庭松长旧枝。\n禅高太白月，行出祖师碑。\n乱後潜来此，南人总不知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"昙域","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47157.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47157","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}